MAP(maddabkmso2)
gv_INPG         abksts          REPLACE
lKUNCIABSEN     abkdata         REPLACE
lnipam          abkkym          REPLACE_IF cjoinsgmam1
lnipmso         abkkym          REPLACE_IF cjoinmsohead1
